 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "This is the family history of Esau, that is, Edom",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He took his wives from the daughters of Canaan",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Adah daughter of Elon, and Oholibamah",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And Basemath daughter of Ishmael",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Adah bore Eliphaz to Esau in the land",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.03,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And Basemath bore Reuel, sons born in Canaan",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Oholibamah bore Jeush, Jalam, and Korah",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Their possessions were too great for them to live together",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The land where they were staying could not support them",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Because of their livestock, they had to move away",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So Esau settled in the hill country of Seir",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He moved to another land, away from his brother Jacob",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This is the family history of Esau, the father of the Edomites",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Eliphaz son of Adah, Reuel son of Basemath",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Chiefs descended from them in the land of Edom",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Teman, Omar, Zepho, Kenaz, and Amalek",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "These were the chiefs among Esau's descendants",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So Esau settled in the hill country of Seir",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He moved to another land, away from his brother Jacob",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This is the family history of Esau, the father of the Edomites",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lotan, Shobal, Zibeon, Anah, Dishon",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Ezer, and Dishan, the Horite chiefs in the land",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Seir the Horite lived there before the kings came",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So Esau settled in the hill country of Seir",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He moved to another land, away from his brother Jacob",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This is the family history of Esau, the father of the Edomites",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
